graph TD
    A([START]) --> B[Gate Officer identifies exiting visitor]
    B --> C[Scan QR / Lookup]
    C --> D{Status == checked_in?}
    D -- No --> E[Flag Anomaly / Prevent Check-Out]
    E --> F([END])
    D -- Yes --> G[Record Check-Out]
    G --> H[(Update Status: checked_out)]
    H --> I[Record action in audit_logs]
    I --> F
